    <data key="d0">Kinai Medical Image Analysis and ML Training Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2XVgpMwY5iE</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture for processing medical images (5TB per project), annotating them on Kubernetes, training models with SageMaker and FSx, and serving predictions while meeting health data compliance (HDS).</data>
    <data key="d3">Healthcare, Machine Learning, Compute, Storage</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
